type none)) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes) (color 0 0 194 1)) (justify top)) (uuid "17f68ee3-9a78-5cc5-ace9-20caed62f958")) (text_box "XL1509-5.0 per its datasheet typical application (L 68 uH / 2 A, Schottky SS34, ON/OFF low = on, FB to the 5 V output): 5 V +-4 % (4.8-5.2 V), 150 kHz. Layout (v1 LEIA-ME 4): C10 / C11 at VIN, loop U1-D3-L2-C12 short.\nDisplay 5 V (review item 4): the CYD's own LDO needs ~4.4 V; through the SS34 it would get 4.3-4.5 V, so R6 0 ohm is fitted and D4 is DNP. D4 only with the JC3248W535; with R6 do not plug the display's USB while the fixture is powered.\nINA226: 50 mohm (R7 || R13), 81.92 mV full scale = 1.64 A; measures the sensor bus only (C-13). VS on +3.3V, not 3.3VA (review: its digital current stays off the analog rail). Kelvin: R7 / R13 side by side, sense from the pad centres.\n3.3VA = +3.3V through R9 10 ohm / C17 1 uF: ADS1115 x 3 and the NTC dividers (calc/checkone_budget.py)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 167.64 0) (size 157.48 27.94) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type solid) (color 204 102 0 1)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "45e47fea-701e-5275-9a59-d4afb8b6920e")) (label "SDA" (at 63.5 156.845 90) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ac108209-de79-5cff-9683-862718db9c85")) (label "SCL" (at 73.66 156.845 90) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0a39b48c-09b6-58df-af92-a370c1795a14")) (text_box "SHEET PORTS" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 241.3 15.24 0) (size 17.78 5.08) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type dash) (color 204 102 0 1)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (color 204 102 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5264936d-07fc-564a-a1c3-7f006896fe36")) (hierarchical_label "SCL" (shape bidirectional) (at 250.19 22.86 180) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid "e9